    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75cfc390f0866fb38ede1a48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目前为止的GⅠ竞赛，大树快车都履战履胜。\n一旦在下一场“英里冠军赛”获得胜利，\n她就能在短距离GⅠ之中留下伟大的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "666a2e586adead258f2647079f1d7a15a8333d6dca8ca9c6d62e9cbeb79a4a71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
